#
# type: dataset — this release is mainly course content and structured data (skills/skills.yaml,
# catalog/, course.yaml and lesson front matter), not a software package. CFF 1.2.0 offers only
# `software` or `dataset`, and `dataset` is the closer fit.
#
# license: CFF 1.2.0 reads a list of licences as alternatives (OR). Our licences apply by path (AND),
# so a list would misstate them. The single value is the licence of the content; the others are
# named in `abstract` and set out in NOTICE.md and REUSE.toml.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use TESA Open Knowledge, please cite it as below and credit TESA as described in
  ATTRIBUTION.md. หากนำ TESA Open Knowledge ไปใช้ โปรดอ้างอิงตามข้อมูลนี้ และให้เครดิต TESA ตาม ATTRIBUTION.md
type: dataset
title: "TESA Open Knowledge"
abstract: >-
  Open courses in embedded systems, IoT, embedded security and Edge AI (slides, lessons and example
  code, learned lesson by lesson), with a machine-readable skill map. Published by the Thai Embedded
  Systems Association (TESA), สมาคมสมองกลฝังตัวไทย. The skill map feeds the Skillset Mapping of the
  TESA Qualification Program (TQP), a joint TESA × Infineon programme whose certification design
  (v0.1) is not yet open for candidates. Licences apply by path: lesson content and slides CC-BY-4.0;
  new code Apache-2.0; code imported from the AIC course MIT; skills/ CC-BY-SA-4.0; third-party
  images keep their own licences (see NOTICE.md and CREDITS.md).
authors:
  - name: "Thai Embedded Systems Association (TESA)"
    alias: "สมาคมสมองกลฝังตัวไทย"
    country: TH
    website: "https://www.tesa.or.th"
contact:
  - name: "Thai Embedded Systems Association (TESA)"
    email: contact@tesa.or.th
    website: "https://www.tesa.or.th/contact"
version: "2026.09"
date-released: "2026-09-25"
repository-code: "https://github.com/tesaiot/tesa-qualification-program"
url: "https://tesaiot.github.io/tesa-qualification-program/"
license: CC-BY-4.0
keywords:
  - embedded systems
  - IoT
  - Edge AI
  - embedded security
  - MicroPython
  - PSOC Edge
  - open educational resources
  - skill map
  - TESA Qualification Program
  - Thai
